# The BIOS scenarios (docs/N3-BIOS-PATH.md). The key sent while the kernel is inside INT 15h AH=86h arrives with IRQ 1 masked; the
# screenshots are taken at the `bios: ready NAME` lines and acknowledged with a key; the last key checks the kernel's own keyboard.
wait input: ready
wait bios: keyboard: waiting
sendkey a
wait bios: ready vbe-640
screendump {out}/vbe-640.ppm
sendkey spc
wait bios: ready vbe-800
screendump {out}/vbe-800.ppm
sendkey spc
wait bios: ready text
screendump {out}/text.ppm
sendkey spc
wait bios: ready keys
sendkey k
